<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60383" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτίσ-ις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>founding, settling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποικιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.190
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.1.4
			</span></i> (pl.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			loosely, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶξις, κούφα κ.</span>
			 an easy <i>achievement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.83
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>creation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κόσμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
					1.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπ᾽ ἀρχῆς κτίσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					10.6
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				13.19
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>created thing, creature</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ju.</u>
				9.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
				16.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				8.19
			</span></i>, etc.: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>To.</u>
				8.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>authority created</i> or <i>ordained</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Pet.</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>.</div>
